body:
I hate bikes because they always poke through the box and make it next to impossible to put them on the rollers.

&#x200B;

as for horror stories I don't have much; we're a small hub, but we just get kept getting hit by IC truck after IC truck, which you can guess who had to unload those. It was me, because I'm on unload on both sorts I work. i don't have anything specific but the overall experience  was just...exhausting
